+<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src &#x27;none&#x27;; script-src &#x27;sha256-X290t2aVRokOwj+RGOnU5RDbjS23mbuZiA1AHsAHwhY=&#x27;; style-src &#x27;self&#x27;; font-src &#x27;none&#x27;; connect-src &#x27;none&#x27;; form-action &#x27;none&#x27;; base-uri &#x27;none&#x27;; object-src &#x27;none&#x27;"><title>Daily essentials in Phuket | Phuket Universe</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/phuket-daily-assets/essentials.css" integrity="sha256-nV5MG9PM7bb0IMBK3+j1gUxtE5VfwPb1gIao+KZClMg="></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><header><a href="/en/phuket-universe#daily-essentials">Back to Phuket Universe</a><a lang="ru" href="/phuket-universe/daily-essentials">Русский</a></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1"><h1>Daily essentials in Phuket</h1><p>Build your own plan for the day: choose what to do today, what can wait, and what is already done.</p><p class="muted">A personal checklist, not a business directory or route calculation. Check the address, opening hours, availability and cost with your chosen place before leaving.</p><fieldset><legend>Your errands</legend><div class="grid"><div class="item"><h3 id="food-title">Groceries and shopping</h3><p id="food-help" class="muted">Make a shopping list. Check opening hours and payment options.</p><select id="food" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="food-title" aria-describedby="food-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="laundry-title">Laundry and household errands</h3><p id="laundry-help" class="muted">Confirm turnaround time, cost and service conditions.</p><select id="laundry" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="laundry-title" aria-describedby="laundry-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="work-title">Work and internet</h3><p id="work-help" class="muted">Check access hours, connectivity, power outlets and whether the space suits your work.</p><select id="work" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="work-title" aria-describedby="work-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="transport-title">Transport</h3><p id="transport-help" class="muted">Compare ways to get there and back; confirm availability and cost before leaving.</p><select id="transport" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="transport-title" aria-describedby="transport-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="services-title">Local services</h3><p id="services-help" class="muted">Check whether an appointment is needed, what to bring and the total price.</p><select id="services" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="services-title" aria-describedby="services-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div><div class="item"><h3 id="leisure-title">Leisure and a walk</h3><p id="leisure-help" class="muted">Choose a place and time; check current access conditions and weather.</p><select id="leisure" data-errand="" aria-labelledby="leisure-title" aria-describedby="leisure-help"><option value="0">Not selected</option><option value="1">Today</option><option value="2">Later</option><option value="3">Done</option></select></div></div></fieldset><section class="plan" id="plan" hidden data-empty="Nothing selected yet."><h2 id="plan-title">Your plan</h2><ul class="counts" aria-live="polite"><li><span data-count-label="">Today</span>: <output data-count="1">0</output></li><li><span data-count-label="">Later</span>: <output data-count="2">0</output></li><li><span data-count-label="">Done</span>: <output data-count="3">0</output></li></ul><textarea id="plan-text" readonly aria-labelledby="plan-title"></textarea><button id="reset" type="button">Reset choices</button></section><noscript><p>Without JavaScript, mark errands manually; counters and the text plan are unavailable.</p></noscript><p class="muted">Select and copy the plan manually if useful. The app does not store or send your choices. Your browser may restore them when you return. Do not enter personal information.</p></main><script src="/phuket-daily-assets/essentials.js" integrity="sha256-X290t2aVRokOwj+RGOnU5RDbjS23mbuZiA1AHsAHwhY="></script></body></html>
